### 2026-10-02: Motion Detector Not Saving Images

#### Symptoms

Motion detection ran but no image appeared in:

```bash
~/predator/events
```

#### Cause

Incorrect file path or filename issue.

#### Fix

Verified event directory:

```bash
mkdir -p ~/predator/events
```

Updated image save location.

#### Lesson Learned

Always check:

```bash
ls ~/predator/events
```

after making changes.

