### 2026-10-02: Unsure Whether Camera Was Stable

#### Symptoms

Camera appeared to work but reliability was unknown.

#### Fix

Created a stability test.

Generated 100 photos:

```bash
for i in {1..100}
do
    rpicam-still -o ~/predator/stability_test/test_$i.jpg
done
```

All images captured successfully.

#### Lesson Learned

Stress testing hardware is worthwhile before deployment.

