### 2026-10-09: Wanted Remote Access

#### Symptoms

Needed a way to view images without SSH.

#### Fix

Started a lightweight web server:

```bash
cd ~/predator
python3 -m http.server 8080
```

Accessed through Tailscale:

```text
http://100.81.140.115:8080
```

#### Lesson Learned

A simple Python web server is often enough.

