### 2026-10-09: First Video Recording Test

#### Goal

Verify camera can record video.

#### Command

```bash
rpicam-vid \
  --codec libav \
  -t 10000 \
  -o ~/predator/videos/test.mp4
```

#### Result

✅ Video created successfully

```bash
ls ~/predator/videos
```

showed:

```text
test.h264
test.mp4
```

#### Lesson Learned

The camera is stable enough for both stills and video recording.

