### 2026-10-09: Tailscale Success

#### Goal

Access predator camera from phone.

#### Result

Connected successfully using:

```text
100.81.140.115
```

and viewed images and videos remotely.

#### Lesson Learned

Tailscale is dramatically easier than port forwarding.

