## Best Commands Learned So Far

Show date:

```bash
date
```

Show files:

```bash
ls
```

Enter project folder:

```bash
cd ~/predator
```

Take photo:

```bash
rpicam-still -o test.jpg
```

Record video:

```bash
rpicam-vid --codec libav -t 10000 -o test.mp4
```

Start web server:

```bash
python3 -m http.server 8080
```

Check Tailscale:

```bash
tailscale status
```

Show Tailscale IP:

```bash
tailscale ip -4
```

